flowchart LR
  raw[地块资源与采集] --> materials[基础材料]
  materials --> parts[中间件与精密部件]
  parts --> equipment[设备与整机]
  equipment --> construction[产能与基础设施]
  construction --> raw
  materials --> supplies[实验与验证物资]
  parts --> supplies
  supplies --> research[研究与工程验证]
  research --> recipes[配方与架构解锁]
  recipes --> equipment
  power[能源与电网] --> materials
  power --> parts
  power --> research
  transport[物流与通行权] --> materials
  transport --> parts
  transport --> equipment
  population[人口与专业技能] --> parts
  population --> research
  equipment --> civil[民生与治理]
  equipment --> military[军事与安全]
  civil --> population
  military --> transport
  diplomacy[外交与产业合作] --> transport
  diplomacy --> research
